  "duration_s": 458.375,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "二零零一年，美国国家安全档案馆解密了一批绝密文件，揭开了一个藏了四十年的秘密。早在上世纪六十年代，美国政府就认真研究过至少五套方案，目标只有一个，在中国拥有核武器之前，彻底摧毁中国的核计划，从特工渗透到海上封锁，从拉拢苏联联手到挑动动周边局势，能用的招全摆上了桌面。可最后这些计划全部作废，不是他们不想，是根本做不到。因为美国情报部门发现，中国核事业最关键的一批人才，几乎都连着同一个人，就算炸掉几座工厂几个基地，就算这支人才队伍还在，中国的核计划就永远炸不掉。这个人叫前三强。他原名钱炳琼，一九一三年出生在浙江湖州的书香世家。父亲钱玄同是新文化运动的先锋，和陈独秀一起编新青年的国学大师。小时候，他排行老三，身体特别壮，同学给他起了个绰号叫三强。父亲一听，觉得这名字好三强，就是品格强，学识强、身体强。于是，钱炳琼正式改名叫钱三强一九三三年，钱三强刚考入清华物理系。父亲亲手写了一幅字，送给他，只有四个字，从牛到爱前三强属牛。父亲希望他发扬那股子牛劲儿，同时向牛顿和爱因斯坦学习。这四个字，他带了一辈子，最后刻在了墓碑上。一九三二年前三强考清华考了第二名，他心里很不服气。更让他意外的是，第一名居然是个女生，叫何泽慧、物理、数学、德文、三科都比他高出三分以上。这份差距让心高气傲的前三强憋足了劲儿，他开始悄悄观察这个对手。女孩每天清晨六点就守在图书馆，研读的都是研究生才涉猎的相对论原理，甚至能左手演算公式，右手绘制晶体结构图前三强，越看越服气。看着看着就看出了别的心思。清华园八年，同窗毕业论文排名何泽惠九十分，第一前三强八十九分。第二，他又输了一分，但他做了一个决定，把第一名娶回家。一九三六年毕业何则会申请南京兵工署，却因为是女生被拒了。他远赴柏林高等工业大学攻读弹道学博士，前三强则赴法国进入居里实验室，一头扎进核物理研究。两人一别就是七年，一九三七年七七事变爆发，父亲病重卧床啊，病榻上的父亲对他说，你学的东西，将来对国家是有用的，报效祖国，造福社会路程。还远得很男儿志在四方，不能只顾近忧前三强，含泪登上了去法国的轮船。他的导师是居里夫人的长女诺贝尔奖得主。伊莲娜飞约里奥居里导师对他的评价是十年期间再到我们实验室，并由我们指导工作的同时代人当中，他是最优秀的。一九四三年，滞留在德国的合泽会和国内亲人彻底失联。彷徨无助之际，他想起了清华的老同学，提笔写下一封短信前三强。你是否仍在巴黎，若方便反省代我向国内父母报平安，这封信成了跨越国界的纽带。此后，两人通信越来越频繁。从学业近况聊到科研难题。从战争局势聊到家国情怀，心越靠越近。一九四六年，钱三强写下求婚信，整封信只有二十五个单词翻译过来，就是经过长期通信，我向你提出结婚的请求，如能同意请回信。何泽慧的回答很干脆，感谢你的爱情，我将对你永远忠诚。等我们见面后，一同回国童年两人在中国驻法国大使馆。注册结婚约里奥居里夫妇特意出席见证，婚后两人携手发现右和三分裂四分裂现象，打破了物理学界原子核只能一分为二的固有认知，被西方媒体称为中国的居里夫妇。一九四七年，三十四岁的前三强成为法国国家科学研究中心最年轻的研究导师，也是第一个拿到这个职位的中国人，留在法国顶尖实验室优厚待遇冲击诺奖的坦途就在眼前。但一九四八年前三强做了一个让所有人惊诧的决定，回国导师挽留。他说，虽然科学没有国界，科学家却是有祖国的，祖国再穷是自己的，而且正因为他贫穷落后后，才更需要我们去努力改变他的面貌。临走时，居里夫人送给他十克碳酸钡酶标准元，还有一些保密的实验数据。一九四八年五月，钱三强和何泽惠抱着刚半岁的女儿带着十几箱国内稀缺的科研器材和绝版专业图书，登上了回国的客船，海上颠簸了一个月。零两天。故事讲到这儿，你可能以为回国之后就是鲜花和掌声，没有等待他们的是一个原子能事业完全空白的中国。而前三强回国后做的第一件事儿，居然不是搞科研，是找人他找的那些人。后来让美国的五套打击方案彻底泡了汤，他到底是怎么在一穷二白的条件下布下中国核事业？这盘大棋的下集告诉你，看到这儿先别划走，点个赞，是对这位铺路石的敬意。收藏起来讲，给你的孩子听真正的国之重器，背后，是一群拿命拼的人，转发给更多人，让钱三强这个名字被更多人记住。关注我，下集更狠，原子弹爆炸那天是他生日，真天后，他被下创农村。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00001",
      "start_ms": 70,
      "end_ms": 1010,
      "text": "二零零一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1230,
      "end_ms": 4950,
      "text": "美国国家安全档案馆解密了一批绝密文件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5390,
      "end_ms": 8130,
      "text": "揭开了一个藏了四十年的秘密。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00004",
      "start_ms": 8870,
      "end_ms": 10690,
      "text": "早在上世纪六十年代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00005",
      "start_ms": 11090,
      "end_ms": 15070,
      "text": "美国政府就认真研究过至少五套方案，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00006",
      "start_ms": 15530,
      "end_ms": 16870,
      "text": "目标只有一个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00007",
      "start_ms": 17410,
      "end_ms": 19510,
      "text": "在中国拥有核武器之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00008",
      "start_ms": 20130,
      "end_ms": 22550,
      "text": "彻底摧毁中国的核计划，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00009",
      "start_ms": 23310,
      "end_ms": 26450,
      "text": "从特工渗透到海上封锁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00010",
      "start_ms": 27130,
      "end_ms": 31120,
      "text": "从拉拢苏联联手到挑动动周边局势，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00011",
      "start_ms": 31680,
      "end_ms": 34420,
      "text": "能用的招全摆上了桌面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00012",
      "start_ms": 34660,
      "end_ms": 37660,
      "text": "可最后这些计划全部作废，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00013",
      "start_ms": 37780,
      "end_ms": 38900,
      "text": "不是他们不想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00014",
      "start_ms": 39260,
      "end_ms": 40460,
      "text": "是根本做不到。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00015",
      "start_ms": 41180,
      "end_ms": 43040,
      "text": "因为美国情报部门发现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00016",
      "start_ms": 43400,
      "end_ms": 46380,
      "text": "中国核事业最关键的一批人才，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00017",
      "start_ms": 46940,
      "end_ms": 48720,
      "text": "几乎都连着同一个人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00018",
      "start_ms": 49540,
      "end_ms": 52780,
      "text": "就算炸掉几座工厂几个基地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00019",
      "start_ms": 53220,
      "end_ms": 55060,
      "text": "就算这支人才队伍还在，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00020",
      "start_ms": 55560,
      "end_ms": 58360,
      "text": "中国的核计划就永远炸不掉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00021",
      "start_ms": 59260,
      "end_ms": 61445,
      "text": "这个人叫前三强。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00022",
      "start_ms": 61790,
      "end_ms": 63395,
      "text": "他原名钱炳琼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00023",
      "start_ms": 64000,
      "end_ms": 68545,
      "text": "一九一三年出生在浙江湖州的书香世家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00024",
      "start_ms": 69100,
      "end_ms": 73015,
      "text": "父亲钱玄同是新文化运动的先锋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00025",
      "start_ms": 73630,
      "end_ms": 77920,
      "text": "和陈独秀一起编新青年的国学大师。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00026",
      "start_ms": 78180,
      "end_ms": 78740,
      "text": "小时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00027",
      "start_ms": 78740,
      "end_ms": 79680,
      "text": "他排行老三，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00028",
      "start_ms": 80020,
      "end_ms": 81145,
      "text": "身体特别壮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00029",
      "start_ms": 81470,
      "end_ms": 84325,
      "text": "同学给他起了个绰号叫三强。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00030",
      "start_ms": 85140,
      "end_ms": 85935,
      "text": "父亲一听，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00031",
      "start_ms": 86260,
      "end_ms": 88110,
      "text": "觉得这名字好三强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00032",
      "start_ms": 88640,
      "end_ms": 89705,
      "text": "就是品格强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00033",
      "start_ms": 90130,
      "end_ms": 92005,
      "text": "学识强、身体强。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00034",
      "start_ms": 92460,
      "end_ms": 92860,
      "text": "于是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00035",
      "start_ms": 92860,
      "end_ms": 97450,
      "text": "钱炳琼正式改名叫钱三强一九三三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00036",
      "start_ms": 97730,
      "end_ms": 100110,
      "text": "钱三强刚考入清华物理系。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00037",
      "start_ms": 100530,
      "end_ms": 102430,
      "text": "父亲亲手写了一幅字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00038",
      "start_ms": 102690,
      "end_ms": 103415,
      "text": "送给他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00039",
      "start_ms": 103680,
      "end_ms": 104495,
      "text": "只有四个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00040",
      "start_ms": 104860,
      "end_ms": 107780,
      "text": "从牛到爱前三强属牛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00041",
      "start_ms": 108240,
      "end_ms": 111015,
      "text": "父亲希望他发扬那股子牛劲儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00042",
      "start_ms": 111380,
      "end_ms": 113860,
      "text": "同时向牛顿和爱因斯坦学习。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00043",
      "start_ms": 114040,
      "end_ms": 114820,
      "text": "这四个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00044",
      "start_ms": 115040,
      "end_ms": 116145,
      "text": "他带了一辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00045",
      "start_ms": 116440,
      "end_ms": 118085,
      "text": "最后刻在了墓碑上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00046",
      "start_ms": 118670,
      "end_ms": 122335,
      "text": "一九三二年前三强考清华考了第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00047",
      "start_ms": 122720,
      "end_ms": 123940,
      "text": "他心里很不服气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00048",
      "start_ms": 124300,
      "end_ms": 125695,
      "text": "更让他意外的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00049",
      "start_ms": 126110,
      "end_ms": 128130,
      "text": "第一名居然是个女生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00050",
      "start_ms": 128470,
      "end_ms": 135625,
      "text": "叫何泽慧、物理、数学、德文、三科都比他高出三分以上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00051",
      "start_ms": 136400,
      "end_ms": 140375,
      "text": "这份差距让心高气傲的前三强憋足了劲儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00052",
      "start_ms": 140920,
      "end_ms": 143245,
      "text": "他开始悄悄观察这个对手。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00053",
      "start_ms": 143690,
      "end_ms": 146905,
      "text": "女孩每天清晨六点就守在图书馆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00054",
      "start_ms": 147470,
      "end_ms": 151390,
      "text": "研读的都是研究生才涉猎的相对论原理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00055",
      "start_ms": 151470,
      "end_ms": 154005,
      "text": "甚至能左手演算公式，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00056",
      "start_ms": 154650,
      "end_ms": 158870,
      "text": "右手绘制晶体结构图前三强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00057",
      "start_ms": 159070,
      "end_ms": 160145,
      "text": "越看越服气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00058",
      "start_ms": 160970,
      "end_ms": 164005,
      "text": "看着看着就看出了别的心思。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00059",
      "start_ms": 165130,
      "end_ms": 166310,
      "text": "清华园八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00060",
      "start_ms": 166350,
      "end_ms": 170540,
      "text": "同窗毕业论文排名何泽惠九十分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00061",
      "start_ms": 170540,
      "end_ms": 172660,
      "text": "第一前三强八十九分。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00062",
      "start_ms": 172660,
      "end_ms": 173015,
      "text": "第二，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00063",
      "start_ms": 173440,
      "end_ms": 174565,
      "text": "他又输了一分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00064",
      "start_ms": 174940,
      "end_ms": 176075,
      "text": "但他做了一个决定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00065",
      "start_ms": 176510,
      "end_ms": 178625,
      "text": "把第一名娶回家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00066",
      "start_ms": 179680,
      "end_ms": 183615,
      "text": "一九三六年毕业何则会申请南京兵工署，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00067",
      "start_ms": 184190,
      "end_ms": 186155,
      "text": "却因为是女生被拒了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00068",
      "start_ms": 186980,
      "end_ms": 191810,
      "text": "他远赴柏林高等工业大学攻读弹道学博士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00069",
      "start_ms": 191970,
      "end_ms": 195305,
      "text": "前三强则赴法国进入居里实验室，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00070",
      "start_ms": 195720,
      "end_ms": 197845,
      "text": "一头扎进核物理研究。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00071",
      "start_ms": 198680,
      "end_ms": 200785,
      "text": "两人一别就是七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00072",
      "start_ms": 201740,
      "end_ms": 204695,
      "text": "一九三七年七七事变爆发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00073",
      "start_ms": 205140,
      "end_ms": 207435,
      "text": "父亲病重卧床啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00074",
      "start_ms": 207640,
      "end_ms": 209295,
      "text": "病榻上的父亲对他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00075",
      "start_ms": 209760,
      "end_ms": 210780,
      "text": "你学的东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00076",
      "start_ms": 210820,
      "end_ms": 212625,
      "text": "将来对国家是有用的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00077",
      "start_ms": 213390,
      "end_ms": 214575,
      "text": "报效祖国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00078",
      "start_ms": 214930,
      "end_ms": 216710,
      "text": "造福社会路程。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00079",
      "start_ms": 216710,
      "end_ms": 219665,
      "text": "还远得很男儿志在四方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00080",
      "start_ms": 219960,
      "end_ms": 222390,
      "text": "不能只顾近忧前三强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00081",
      "start_ms": 222410,
      "end_ms": 224965,
      "text": "含泪登上了去法国的轮船。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00082",
      "start_ms": 225480,
      "end_ms": 229915,
      "text": "他的导师是居里夫人的长女诺贝尔奖得主。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00083",
      "start_ms": 230260,
      "end_ms": 237225,
      "text": "伊莲娜飞约里奥居里导师对他的评价是十年期间再到我们实验室，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00084",
      "start_ms": 237560,
      "end_ms": 240745,
      "text": "并由我们指导工作的同时代人当中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00085",
      "start_ms": 241180,
      "end_ms": 242355,
      "text": "他是最优秀的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00086",
      "start_ms": 244040,
      "end_ms": 244975,
      "text": "一九四三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00087",
      "start_ms": 245500,
      "end_ms": 248925,
      "text": "滞留在德国的合泽会和国内亲人彻底失联。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00088",
      "start_ms": 249500,
      "end_ms": 250835,
      "text": "彷徨无助之际，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00089",
      "start_ms": 251120,
      "end_ms": 253065,
      "text": "他想起了清华的老同学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00090",
      "start_ms": 253440,
      "end_ms": 256665,
      "text": "提笔写下一封短信前三强。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00091",
      "start_ms": 257030,
      "end_ms": 258775,
      "text": "你是否仍在巴黎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00092",
      "start_ms": 259370,
      "end_ms": 263825,
      "text": "若方便反省代我向国内父母报平安，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00093",
      "start_ms": 264650,
      "end_ms": 267485,
      "text": "这封信成了跨越国界的纽带。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00094",
      "start_ms": 268260,
      "end_ms": 268680,
      "text": "此后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00095",
      "start_ms": 268720,
      "end_ms": 271180,
      "text": "两人通信越来越频繁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00096",
      "start_ms": 271240,
      "end_ms": 274015,
      "text": "从学业近况聊到科研难题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00097",
      "start_ms": 274390,
      "end_ms": 276950,
      "text": "从战争局势聊到家国情怀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00098",
      "start_ms": 277350,
      "end_ms": 278965,
      "text": "心越靠越近。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00099",
      "start_ms": 279790,
      "end_ms": 280875,
      "text": "一九四六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00100",
      "start_ms": 281380,
      "end_ms": 283075,
      "text": "钱三强写下求婚信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00101",
      "start_ms": 283470,
      "end_ms": 286850,
      "text": "整封信只有二十五个单词翻译过来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00102",
      "start_ms": 286850,
      "end_ms": 289115,
      "text": "就是经过长期通信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00103",
      "start_ms": 289560,
      "end_ms": 291680,
      "text": "我向你提出结婚的请求，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00104",
      "start_ms": 292380,
      "end_ms": 294355,
      "text": "如能同意请回信。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00105",
      "start_ms": 294850,
      "end_ms": 296535,
      "text": "何泽慧的回答很干脆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00106",
      "start_ms": 296920,
      "end_ms": 298105,
      "text": "感谢你的爱情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00107",
      "start_ms": 298490,
      "end_ms": 300250,
      "text": "我将对你永远忠诚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00108",
      "start_ms": 300730,
      "end_ms": 301970,
      "text": "等我们见面后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00109",
      "start_ms": 302130,
      "end_ms": 307315,
      "text": "一同回国童年两人在中国驻法国大使馆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00110",
      "start_ms": 307630,
      "end_ms": 313650,
      "text": "注册结婚约里奥居里夫妇特意出席见证，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00111",
      "start_ms": 314430,
      "end_ms": 319810,
      "text": "婚后两人携手发现右和三分裂四分裂现象，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00112",
      "start_ms": 320850,
      "end_ms": 325850,
      "text": "打破了物理学界原子核只能一分为二的固有认知，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00113",
      "start_ms": 326390,
      "end_ms": 330290,
      "text": "被西方媒体称为中国的居里夫妇。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00114",
      "start_ms": 331330,
      "end_ms": 332370,
      "text": "一九四七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00115",
      "start_ms": 333050,
      "end_ms": 339640,
      "text": "三十四岁的前三强成为法国国家科学研究中心最年轻的研究导师，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00116",
      "start_ms": 340140,
      "end_ms": 343360,
      "text": "也是第一个拿到这个职位的中国人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00117",
      "start_ms": 343820,
      "end_ms": 351560,
      "text": "留在法国顶尖实验室优厚待遇冲击诺奖的坦途就在眼前。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00118",
      "start_ms": 351760,
      "end_ms": 356340,
      "text": "但一九四八年前三强做了一个让所有人惊诧的决定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00119",
      "start_ms": 356700,
      "end_ms": 358260,
      "text": "回国导师挽留。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00120",
      "start_ms": 358620,
      "end_ms": 359040,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00121",
      "start_ms": 359460,
      "end_ms": 360940,
      "text": "虽然科学没有国界，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00122",
      "start_ms": 361080,
      "end_ms": 362740,
      "text": "科学家却是有祖国的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00123",
      "start_ms": 363100,
      "end_ms": 364840,
      "text": "祖国再穷是自己的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00124",
      "start_ms": 365040,
      "end_ms": 367845,
      "text": "而且正因为他贫穷落后后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00125",
      "start_ms": 368240,
      "end_ms": 372065,
      "text": "才更需要我们去努力改变他的面貌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00126",
      "start_ms": 372740,
      "end_ms": 373625,
      "text": "临走时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00127",
      "start_ms": 374030,
      "end_ms": 378395,
      "text": "居里夫人送给他十克碳酸钡酶标准元，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00128",
      "start_ms": 379010,
      "end_ms": 381085,
      "text": "还有一些保密的实验数据。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00129",
      "start_ms": 382240,
      "end_ms": 383540,
      "text": "一九四八年五月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00130",
      "start_ms": 383780,
      "end_ms": 391040,
      "text": "钱三强和何泽惠抱着刚半岁的女儿带着十几箱国内稀缺的科研器材和绝版专业图书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00131",
      "start_ms": 391260,
      "end_ms": 392865,
      "text": "登上了回国的客船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00132",
      "start_ms": 393440,
      "end_ms": 395280,
      "text": "海上颠簸了一个月。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00133",
      "start_ms": 395600,
      "end_ms": 396365,
      "text": "零两天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00134",
      "start_ms": 397100,
      "end_ms": 398145,
      "text": "故事讲到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00135",
      "start_ms": 398330,
      "end_ms": 401415,
      "text": "你可能以为回国之后就是鲜花和掌声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00136",
      "start_ms": 401820,
      "end_ms": 407545,
      "text": "没有等待他们的是一个原子能事业完全空白的中国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00137",
      "start_ms": 408450,
      "end_ms": 411295,
      "text": "而前三强回国后做的第一件事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00138",
      "start_ms": 411770,
      "end_ms": 413190,
      "text": "居然不是搞科研，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00139",
      "start_ms": 413390,
      "end_ms": 416175,
      "text": "是找人他找的那些人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00140",
      "start_ms": 416680,
      "end_ms": 420045,
      "text": "后来让美国的五套打击方案彻底泡了汤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00141",
      "start_ms": 420770,
      "end_ms": 425850,
      "text": "他到底是怎么在一穷二白的条件下布下中国核事业？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00142",
      "start_ms": 425850,
      "end_ms": 428770,
      "text": "这盘大棋的下集告诉你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00143",
      "start_ms": 429670,
      "end_ms": 431470,
      "text": "看到这儿先别划走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00144",
      "start_ms": 432330,
      "end_ms": 432970,
      "text": "点个赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00145",
      "start_ms": 433830,
      "end_ms": 436150,
      "text": "是对这位铺路石的敬意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00146",
      "start_ms": 436370,
      "end_ms": 437890,
      "text": "收藏起来讲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00147",
      "start_ms": 437930,
      "end_ms": 441410,
      "text": "给你的孩子听真正的国之重器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00148",
      "start_ms": 441790,
      "end_ms": 442310,
      "text": "背后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00149",
      "start_ms": 442530,
      "end_ms": 444570,
      "text": "是一群拿命拼的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00150",
      "start_ms": 444890,
      "end_ms": 446370,
      "text": "转发给更多人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00151",
      "start_ms": 446950,
      "end_ms": 449970,
      "text": "让钱三强这个名字被更多人记住。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00152",
      "start_ms": 450270,
      "end_ms": 450970,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00153",
      "start_ms": 451150,
      "end_ms": 452050,
      "text": "下集更狠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00154",
      "start_ms": 453630,
      "end_ms": 455590,
      "text": "原子弹爆炸那天是他生日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00155",
      "start_ms": 456110,
      "end_ms": 456850,
      "text": "真天后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_560ac5ec2c5746f1_s00156",
      "start_ms": 456930,
      "end_ms": 458145,
      "text": "他被下创农村。"
    }
  ],
